Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:56.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《蜘蛛侠3》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是彼得·帕克 你所熟知的友善邻居{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, Peter Parker. Your friendly neighborhood... ...you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:25.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从被蜘蛛咬了之后 我经历了太多的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come a long way from being the boy who was bit by a spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说一切好像都不太正常了 但现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back then, nothing seemed to go right for me. Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:29.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 看 是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, look, it's Spider-Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.07,0:03:31.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 实在太酷了 - 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Super cool! - Spider-man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家确实都很喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...people really like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:36.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下啊 过一会儿还要重播的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick around. It's gonna start again in a couple minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:39.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:42.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,城市安然无恙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city is safe and sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:44.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这也有我的一份功劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I've had something to do with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的叔叔班也一定会以我为荣的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Uncle Ben would be proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:54.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是会去上学 成绩也不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still get to school. Top of my class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汉密尔顿函数告诉我们的就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the Hamiltonian shows us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:04:00.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能级是由能量场所决定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that the energy levels are perturbed by the electric field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:07.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这个矩阵的形式 我们能看到什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the form of this matrix, we can see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔西小姐?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Stacy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:13.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是说只有质量为零的量子态才会受其影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That only the "m equals zero quantum states" are affected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:16.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正确 说的不错 斯塔西小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correct. Good work, Miss Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:24.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克? 你还有什么要补充的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker? You got something to add?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.10,0:04:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我与我的梦中女孩坠入了情网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm in love with the girl of my dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:50.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:54.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,华森小姐给我留了一张票 彼得·帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Watson left a ticket for me. Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:57.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:04:59.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:08.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好紧张啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:34.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的女朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我觉得她很棒 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought she was good. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:53.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:57.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要解释一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explain things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:05.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就跟我父亲说吧 那会让他起死回生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell it to my father. Raise him from the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的朋友 哈利 我也很在乎你的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your friend, Harry. I cared about your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M. J!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 彼得! - 祝贺你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter! - Congrats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.81,0:07:26.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还行吗? - 行吗? 你简直太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was I good? - Good? You were great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:28.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你真的是... - 你说了 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You were... - You said great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:32.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这些花 它们真漂亮 是哈利送的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love my flowers, they're beautiful. And those are from Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:36.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他今晚来了吗? - 来了 我在外面碰到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was he here tonight? - Yeah, I ran into him outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:39.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那你们怎么样了? - 一言难尽啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's with you guys anyway? - It's complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再跟我说一遍 我是不是很棒?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me again. Was I really good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:44.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好紧张啊 膝盖一直在发抖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so nervous. My knees were shaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:47.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的膝盖很好 - 但是欢呼声好像不太热烈啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your knees were fine. - The applause wasn't very loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:49.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 挺好的啊! 嗯 这是个声学问题!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it was. Well, it's the acoustics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:52.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与其传播的方式有关 声音会以波群的形式传播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all about diffusion. It keeps the sound waves from grouping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:55.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当声音形成波动时 会向前传播 就像是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the sound waves, they propagate, then it's like an...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这个书呆子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are such a nerd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.56,0:08:52.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:03.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:08.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我下半辈子都想这样在舞台上演唱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to sing on-stage for the rest of my life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:10.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要坐在第一排{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with you in the first row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 你爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:22.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.03,0:09:25.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一直如此!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:17.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好了? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:15.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能躲在这儿 弗林特!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hide here, Flint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:19.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只是来看我女儿的 - 你是个逃犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm just here to see my daughter. - You are an escaped convict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:23.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警察正在找你 你不能接近她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cops are looking for you. You're not getting near her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:27.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只不过是个普通的小偷而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nothing but a common thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你可能还杀了人 对吗? - 不是那样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You maybe even killed a man? - It wasn't like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.92,0:12:33.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:35.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我那么做都是事出有因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had good reason for what I was doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:37.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:41.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是和你的事实一起呆在监狱里 享受你们的一日三餐好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and the truth, sitting in prison, having three meals a day together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:44.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也在所谓的事实中生活着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live in the presence of great truth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:49.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个事实就在你身后的那间卧室里面呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that is the truth that you left behind... ...right there in that bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,佩妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:07.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:11.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想你 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss you too, Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:25.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证 我一定会让你的身体好起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise I'll make you healthy again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.87,0:13:28.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管如何 我一定会弄到钱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it takes, I'll get the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:32.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我出去 马上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get out of here. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:45.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a bad person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过运气比较坏罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just had bad luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:08.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 这是怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:12.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是关于玛莉的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:16.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想向她求婚 - 哦 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna ask her to marry me. - Oh, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:23.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的叔叔班向我求婚的时候 我们都怕得要命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day your Uncle Ben asked me to marry him, we were so scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:25.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很激动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然也很年轻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And very young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是如此的爱他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I loved him so fiercely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:32.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后你就答应他了? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you said yes, right? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:35.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想答应他 但是我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to say yes, but I said no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.51,0:14:38.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有准备好 他也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't ready. Neither was he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:40.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此我们继续等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we took our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.88,0:14:43.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一起期盼着那一天的到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looked forward to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:47.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人们不能仅仅只靠爱情生活下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't want to run into something with nothing to count on but love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:51.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个男人一定要明白这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man has to be understanding...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:54.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后才能向女孩子求婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and put his wife before himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:57.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能做到吗 彼得?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do that, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:02.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我想我可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:05.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我祝你成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you have my blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.87,0:15:10.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你最好考虑一个计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you've considered a proper proposal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:14.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的叔叔可是周密安排过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your uncle had it all planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.61,0:15:16.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在一个周日把我带到海边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took me to the beach one Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:19.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他穿着泳衣是如此的迷人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he was a knockout in his bathing suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来也不差啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I didn't look too bad myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是游泳健将{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were very good swimmers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:27.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那天天气不错 然后他说：{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was a beautiful day and he said:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:29.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"咱们游到那个岛上去吧"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Let's swim to the island."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:34.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那个岛上 我们在一棵老树边找到个不错的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And at the island, we found a perfect spot by an old tree...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:38.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,躺在那里 仰望着天空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we lay down and looked up at the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:41.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后她说 "闭上眼睛 梅! "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he said, "Close your eyes, May."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我闭上了 他又说 "可以睁开了"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did. And then he said, "Open them."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:46.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我又睁开了眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:49.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到他正拿着这只戒指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he was holding this ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:52.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,光芒四射的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dazzling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:54.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在我的眼前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in front of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.89,0:15:59.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得就像太阳一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:04.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到八月份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd be married 50 years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就结婚50年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...come August if...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:23.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能为玛莉好好准备一番{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I hope you'll make it very special for Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:27.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做些让她永生难忘的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do something she'll never forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:31.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个给她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give her this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:36.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 拿着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈利 - 你知道是怎么回事的 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Harry. - You knew this was coming, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:02.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听我说 我没有杀死你的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. I didn't kill your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:05.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想杀了我 但是却误杀了自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was trying to kill me. He killed himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:52.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还在这儿呢 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still here, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:18.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,烦死那些玩意儿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hate those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:18.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:23.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.25,0:21:33.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:41.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:45.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:49.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:54.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 心脏除颤仪 - 电压200{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Defib. - Two hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:57.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:21:59.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 重新充电 再试一次 - 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Recharge, let's go again. - Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:02.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 充电 - 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charging. - And clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:03.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:06.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重新再试一次 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's recharge and do it one more time. And clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.59,0:22:14.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔西队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.93,0:22:16.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了? - 弗林特·马克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this? - Flint Marko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:18.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确信是班·帕克凶杀的嫌犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy we tied to the Ben Parker homicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.63,0:22:20.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他怎么了? - 从莱克岛的监狱逃跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about him? - Broke out of Rikers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.63,0:22:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在呢? - 仍然在逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And? - He's on the run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在沼泽地现身了 我们发现他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in the marshlands. I think we got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:30.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.96,0:22:51.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个从西面包抄 汤米 走东边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two, take the west side. Tommy, take the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:57.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跑哪儿去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.99,0:23:21.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 电容充电完毕 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Capacitors charged. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:23.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唐尼 在一号机出现了小的波动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, we got a little fluctuation on one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:27.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 硅元素的质量有改变 - 可能是只鸟 等会儿就飞走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a change in the silicon mass. - It's probably a bird. It'll fly away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.93,0:23:29.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始进行分子合成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiating demolecularization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:01.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他怎么样了? - 会好起来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is he? - He's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:04.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但可能会出现记忆缺失的现象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's been some memory impairment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是他的短期记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Particularly his short-term memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:08.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在不记得那场事故了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now he can't remember the accident...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.54,0:25:10.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有最近身边发生的所有事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or anything that happened to him recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.80,0:25:12.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会一直这样吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it permanent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:15.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧 只有时间才能证明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be. Only time will tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:17.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他醒了 你可以去看他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's awake if you wanna see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.04,0:25:19.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是等一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.48,0:25:22.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的 简单说一下就行了 他还需要休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's fine. Just keep it brief. I want him to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.97,0:25:43.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:45.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.07,0:25:47.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撞到头了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.81,0:25:49.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.58,0:25:51.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,医生说我遇到意外了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor said I was in an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.01,0:25:53.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撞了我就跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit-and-run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.81,0:25:56.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我都记不起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember much of anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.88,0:25:59.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.15,0:26:01.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he died, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:06.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是太不可思议了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all so weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.63,0:26:11.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我尽快赶过来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I got here as fast as I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:12.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这张脸我认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.77,0:26:13.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:15.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.84,0:26:17.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得的最后一件事 就是我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last thing I remember, I was fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.07,0:26:19.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在某处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:21.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在也很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:24.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都很爱你 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We love you, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.25,0:26:27.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉就像是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.08,0:26:31.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出去了很长很长的一段时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...somehow I've been gone for a really long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.15,0:26:34.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我又回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I'm back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.49,0:26:37.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到你能回来太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to have you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.63,0:26:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我想可能得让你们离开了 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I'm gonna have to ask you guys to scoot, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:44.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 - 那好 多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - All right. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.40,0:26:46.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们明天见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.53,0:26:48.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.34,0:26:50.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,睡会儿吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.37,0:26:56.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想他会好起来的 - 我想也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think he's gonna be fine. - I think so.{\r}
