Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.82,0:31:01.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这个... 听着 你真的很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, this... Listen, you were great.{\r}
