Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.93,0:31:09.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 我能理解 蜘蛛侠也总是被人攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I know. Spider-Man gets attacked all the time.{\r}
