Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.18,0:31:26.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望你能明白我的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and understand how I feel.{\r}
