Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.76,0:31:46.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有巡逻车注意 请在第54街和第6街路口处的车辆报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All cars. All cars in the vicinity of 54th and Sixth Avenue, please report.{\r}
