Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.28,0:32:37.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你派给我们的那个起重机的任务 比我们想象的要大得多啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That crane job you sent us on? It's bigger than we thought.{\r}
