Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.63,0:32:50.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把发电机关掉 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it down at the generator. Now!{\r}
