Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.04,0:34:10.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 天啊 是格温 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God. That's Gwen. - What?{\r}
