Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.86,0:35:33.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 感谢上帝 你没事 - 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank God you're okay. - Daddy.{\r}
