Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.62,0:37:45.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我用的是"滚蛋"!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called Go Away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.39,0:37:47.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我听过的最蠢的创意...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the dumbest idea you've ever had...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.53,0:37:50.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还真行啊 - 注意血压{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and you have had some doozies. - Blood pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.80,0:37:52.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你要去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.17,0:37:56.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁啊? - 你上周雇的他 一个自由记者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - You hired him last week. Freelance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.80,0:37:59.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗? 什么味道啊? - 我叫布洛克 先生 小爱德华·布洛克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I did? What's that smell? - It's Brock, sir. Edward Brock Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.04,0:38:03.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢那件衬衫 这是关于起重机事件的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I just say I really like that shirt? It's the crane accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.54,0:38:05.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好好瞧瞧吧 - 他喜欢我的衬衫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Check out the light. - He likes my shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.58,0:38:06.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 贝蒂 - 嘿 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Betty. - Hey, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.88,0:38:08.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好马上进去 来了个新人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get in there. New guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.78,0:38:11.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他正要卖他的蜘蛛侠照片呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to sell some Spidey photos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.19,0:38:14.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.89,0:38:17.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克 你来迟了 可能太迟了 布拉克已经打败你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker. You're late, maybe too late. Bruckner beat you to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.02,0:38:19.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是布洛克 先生 小爱德华·布洛克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Brock, sir. Edward Brock Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.79,0:38:22.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但是我给你弄到了这个 - 但是他已经给我弄到了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I got you this. - But he got me this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.29,0:38:24.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在那儿并没有看到你 你怎么会在那么高的地方?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see you there. How'd you get that high?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.83,0:38:27.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爬上去的 差点从旗杆那儿掉下去 - 旗杆?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Climbed. Nearly fell off a flagpole. - A flagpole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:30.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们用谁的? - 我喜欢伯恩斯坦的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which one do we use? - I like Bernstein's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.87,0:38:32.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好一点 - 也便宜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's better. - Cheaper too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.27,0:38:34.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祝贺你 我们会用你的 我会付你50美元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, we'll use yours. I'll pay you 50 bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.14,0:38:36.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我现在是你的人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, J.J., I'm your man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.74,0:38:39.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我比那些普通摄影师更懂得 什么样的才是好照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know more about a good picture than any photographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.61,0:38:43.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧 摄影并不仅仅是些 旗杆啊或者其他什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, photography, it's not just about, no offense, flagpoles or whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.52,0:38:45.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是要融合光线 布局 还有戏剧性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about lighting. Composition. Drama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.65,0:38:48.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要这份工作 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a staff job, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.22,0:38:51.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个女孩 我想要与其厮守终身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a girl that I intend to marry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.56,0:38:54.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜 我也不知道 我有个愚蠢的小小的梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I guess, I don't know, I have this stupid little dream...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.63,0:38:58.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是想与这个时代最伟大的报纸主编共事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of working with one of the greatest newspaper editors of our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.73,0:39:00.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是约拿·詹姆士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J. Jonah Jameson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.50,0:39:06.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我们正好有空缺岗位 约翰逊辞职了 记得吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we do have an opening. Johnson quit, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.44,0:39:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你炒了他的鱿鱼 - 不管怎么样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You fired him. - Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.77,0:39:10.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道什么样的才是好照片 我也来了很长时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what makes a good picture and I've been here a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.88,0:39:12.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有一个工作的话 我想应给给我才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's a staff job, I think I deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.15,0:39:16.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说得对 约拿 彼得跟我们共事多年了 他干得很不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right, Jonah. Peter's been with us for years. He's done a great job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.08,0:39:19.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要这份工作 你也想要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a staff job, you want a staff job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.22,0:39:21.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那有没有人关心我想要什么呢? - 我啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anybody care about what I want? - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.22,0:39:22.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.19,0:39:26.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要公众知道 蜘蛛侠不过是个微不足道的罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the public to see Spider-Man for the two-bit criminal he really is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.79,0:39:30.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个冒牌货 混身黏糊糊的 要抓他个正着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a fake, he's full of stickum. Catch him in the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.16,0:39:33.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠偷饼干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man with his hand in a cookie jar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.63,0:39:35.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁能把这张照片带来 就能得到这份工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever brings me that photo gets a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.77,0:39:37.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们等什么呢 中国的春节吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What're you waiting for, Chinese New Year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.84,0:39:39.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上开工 老板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.74,0:39:41.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远也不会拍到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never get that shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.17,0:39:43.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 那走着瞧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.02,0:39:57.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(蜘蛛侠成为城市英雄 蜘蛛侠拯救了警局队长的女儿)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.02,0:40:03.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜只有一人才能如此与众不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I guess one person can make a difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:06.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不多说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:14.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回家 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.87,0:40:18.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 感谢上帝你没事了 - 谢谢你 伯纳德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank God you're all right. - Thanks, Bernard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.38,0:40:20.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伯纳德 - 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bernard. - Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.55,0:40:25.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你个回家的小礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you a little homecoming present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.15,0:40:27.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是你原来的球啊 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's your old ball. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.02,0:40:29.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.89,0:40:32.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们在后院打得不错 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were pretty good in the backyard, weren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.32,0:40:35.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们都差劲的了 还想加入大学代表队呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were terrible. And we tried out for the varsity team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.16,0:40:38.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为了那些啦啦队员 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For the cheerleaders. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.36,0:40:40.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 我有没有女朋友啊? - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, do I have any girlfriends? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.10,0:40:42.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.80,0:40:45.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伯纳德 我有女朋友吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Bernard. Do I have any girlfriends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.60,0:40:48.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知没有 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I know of, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:55.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方还不错 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pretty cool pad, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.41,0:40:57.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一般般了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.28,0:41:00.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最起码我不是为了钱去受伤的 - 当然不是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looks like I'm not hurting for money. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.39,0:41:04.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 也许我还可以 让没有女朋友的状况有所改观{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe I can turn this no-girlfriend thing around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.73,0:41:16.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 他一直很感激你 帮我度过高中时候的难关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, he always appreciated how you helped me through high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.34,0:41:19.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是能多回忆一点关于他的事情就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wish I could remember more about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.44,0:41:24.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是爱你的 这才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he loved you. That's the main thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.05,0:41:30.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 咱们去厨房看比赛吧 去找点吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, let's watch a game in the kitchen. Get something to eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.62,0:41:31.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.15,0:41:34.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heads up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.92,0:41:38.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.73,0:41:41.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还是动作敏捷啊 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Still got the moves. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.59,0:42:16.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要停下来啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we stopping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.87,0:42:21.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在这儿干什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is she doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.10,0:42:23.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加里会给她的经纪人打电话的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Gary was supposed to call her agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.61,0:42:29.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 亲爱的 我们一直在联系你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, honey. We tried to reach you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.44,0:42:30.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.14,0:42:32.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为一篇批评?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One critic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.44,0:42:33.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是所有的报纸 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, all the papers, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.61,0:42:37.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉 亲爱的 坐下说 我跟你解释一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane, honey, sit down. Let us explain it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.22,0:42:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 如果你愿意 我们可以说你病了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, if you'd like, we could say you became ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.83,0:42:52.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿解决得也太逊了点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was so poorly handled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.97,0:42:54.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.97,0:42:56.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,专心排练吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just rehearse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.51,0:43:04.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Spidey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.12,0:43:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠!蜘蛛侠!蜘蛛侠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spidey! Spidey! Spidey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.28,0:43:48.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰一下 小姐? 能像我再展示一下您的迷人微笑吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, miss? Could I please see that gorgeous smile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.05,0:43:50.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 埃迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.99,0:43:54.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,简直太美了 绝对该上头版{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so beautiful. This is front-page stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.29,0:43:55.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有事要做 等会儿见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta practice. See you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.06,0:43:57.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 今晚怎么样? - 今晚不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about tonight? - Not tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.13,0:43:59.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不行?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.73,0:44:03.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不记得那个非常非常激动人心的夜晚了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about that amazing, amazing night that we had?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.74,0:44:07.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只不过喝了杯咖啡罢了 埃迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a coffee, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.04,0:44:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 美人儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.41,0:44:11.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再来一张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.15,0:44:17.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧? - 嗯 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything okay? - Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.68,0:44:21.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没有在生我的气了 对吗? - 没有 彼得 我以你为荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not still mad at me, are you? - No, Peter, I'm proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.99,0:44:24.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我会从那边旋转着飞进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm gonna be swinging in from over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.26,0:44:26.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 是吗? - 那你知道该在哪里看了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, yeah? - So you know where to look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.93,0:44:29.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好好表演一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give them a good show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.13,0:44:31.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要担心那些评论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about that review.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.70,0:44:35.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了明晚就可以将它付之一笑了 我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be laughing about it tomorrow night, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.33,0:44:36.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.55,0:44:56.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个是不是越狱的人啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that that guy from that prison break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.49,0:44:57.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很像啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.09,0:45:00.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你 站住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you. Halt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.43,0:45:03.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抄后路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.60,0:45:08.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 小心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon, be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.22,0:45:58.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在车里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.48,0:46:00.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round the front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.53,0:46:15.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.05,0:46:40.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约的市民们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People of the city of New York...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.75,0:46:44.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我到这儿来是因为我从62楼摔了下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I am here today because I fell 62 stories...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.42,0:46:46.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但有一个人抓住并救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and someone caught me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.23,0:46:49.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个人没有要求任何回报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone who never asks for anything in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.39,0:46:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他甚至不希望我们知道他是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone who doesn't even want us to know who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.23,0:46:54.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.47,0:46:56.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈利 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Harry. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.00,0:46:58.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Pete?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.24,0:47:01.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我猜 可能去给某人照相了 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Taking somebody's picture, I guess. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.51,0:47:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴能见到你 你看起来很好 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so happy to see you. You look so good, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.44,0:47:05.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也从未感觉这么好过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never felt better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.94,0:47:08.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连你是谁都不知道了 真是太奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a weird feeling not knowing who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.25,0:47:10.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撞了下头 就像小鸟一样无忧无虑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bump on the head, I'm as free as a bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.25,0:47:13.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你能不能也让我撞一下啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you bump me on the head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.65,0:47:17.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 彼得说你正在参加戏剧表演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Pete said you're in a play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.12,0:47:20.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也来了 还给我送了花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came. You sent me flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.96,0:47:23.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我送花了? 我今晚还会再来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did? I'll come again tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.10,0:47:27.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来不了了 因为我被解雇了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't. I was let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.33,0:47:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.67,0:47:32.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能不够优秀吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.67,0:47:35.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是够让人难受的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, this is embarrassing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.84,0:47:38.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我在高中时还给你写过一出戏呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I once wrote you a play in high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.31,0:47:39.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你给我写了一出戏? - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wrote me a play? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.15,0:47:41.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利 你真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry, that's the sweetest thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.91,0:47:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我问你们 当你们没有降落伞 就从天而降时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I ask you: When you're dropping without a parachute...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.28,0:47:48.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者是你的店铺被抢 你的房子着了火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or your store's being robbed or your house is on fire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.85,0:47:50.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会将你从坠落的空中救下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who is it that breaks your fall...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.12,0:47:54.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会扑灭火焰 拯救你的孩子?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...puts out the flames and saves your children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.96,0:47:56.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.80,0:47:57.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They love me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.06,0:48:01.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那接下来就让我们见识一下...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let's hear it for your one and only...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.57,0:48:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的友善邻居 蜘蛛侠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...friendly neighborhood Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.08,0:48:21.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 怎么了? 好样的! 你好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. What's up? All right. How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.92,0:48:24.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,厉害啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shazam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.89,0:48:27.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.06,0:48:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠! 蜘蛛侠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man. Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.86,0:48:32.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 在那儿 嘿!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey there. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.87,0:48:35.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吻他 - 吻他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kiss him. - Kiss him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.33,0:48:38.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吻他 吻他 吻他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss him. Kiss him. Kiss him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.14,0:48:40.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 亲一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, lay one on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.84,0:48:42.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的吗? - 是啊 他们会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah, they'll love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.77,0:48:44.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吻她 - 吻他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kiss her. - Kiss him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.44,0:48:45.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 蜘蛛侠 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Spider-Man, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.91,0:48:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.52,0:48:59.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望彼得能够拍到一张照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope Pete's getting a shot of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.73,0:49:06.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.83,0:49:08.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.15,0:49:56.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计 车顶上是什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, we got something on the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.84,0:50:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,游戏结束了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jig's up, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.84,0:50:23.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想伤害你 快走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna hurt you. Leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.81,0:50:27.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你可能还没有听说吧 我是这一片的治安官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you haven't heard. I'm the sheriff around these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.21,0:50:28.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.99,0:51:08.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.89,0:51:45.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙都是从哪里来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do all these guys come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.98,0:52:40.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我不会说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I don't speak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.48,0:52:43.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但这里是法国餐馆 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this is a French restaurant, non?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.82,0:52:49.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 您的名字 先生? - 帕克 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Name, please? - Parker, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.66,0:52:54.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.13,0:52:57.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个人的桌子 派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Table for two. Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.50,0:53:02.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帕克 - 我就是这么说 派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Parker. - That is what I said: Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.54,0:53:06.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.11,0:53:11.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的女朋友会来 我有一只戒指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My girlfriend will be coming and I have this ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.82,0:53:18.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.58,0:53:21.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 那就是说你今晚要求婚了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, so you want to pop the question tonight, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.62,0:53:24.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 因此我想有点特别的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and I wanna do something very special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.62,0:53:27.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢 很浪漫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it. Romance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.26,0:53:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是法国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am French.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.83,0:53:34.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我示意你的时候 你就把香槟和戒指拿上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I signal you, if you'd bring some champagne with the ring...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.53,0:53:36.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放在她的杯底 - 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In the bottom of her glass? - Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.94,0:53:40.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 我想在同时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, I thought at the same time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.27,0:53:43.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果那些演奏家能演奏这首曲子的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if the musicians would play this song...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.91,0:53:46.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定会乐意效劳的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.38,0:53:49.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心别弄丢了戒指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And take good care of the ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.98,0:53:52.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 我用生命担保 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oui, with my life, monsieur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.59,0:53:57.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.36,0:54:01.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.14,0:54:15.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 那...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:18.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想不想来点香槟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, would you like some champagne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.85,0:54:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会跑到那里面去的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd that get in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.32,0:54:27.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不要哭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.59,0:54:33.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.79,0:54:36.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你 哦 太美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you. Wow, beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.00,0:54:38.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.80,0:54:44.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方你能消费的起吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place in your budget?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.54,0:54:46.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这是个特殊场合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, it's a special occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.44,0:54:48.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是百老汇的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on Broadway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.34,0:54:52.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚可没有感觉到自己是明星啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel like much of a star tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.51,0:54:55.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你是明星 你已经是明星了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you are a star. And you've earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.41,0:54:57.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.12,0:55:01.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不明白我现在的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you have no idea how I feel right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.25,0:55:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不 我很清楚你的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, I know exactly how you feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.82,0:55:09.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我也经历过这些 这些也无时无刻不发生在我的身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I have been through this. It happens to me all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.33,0:55:11.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到窗户上蜘蛛侠的海报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see Spider-Man posters in the window...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.46,0:55:13.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,街上跑着的孩子穿着印有我的毛衫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...kids running around with me on their sweaters...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.97,0:55:15.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,万圣节产品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big Halloween item.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.80,0:55:18.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道 我猜我已经变成了某种偶像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, I guess I've become something of an icon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.80,0:55:23.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像昨天 他们不停地高呼:"蜘蛛侠! 蜘蛛侠!"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like yesterday, they kept screaming, "Spider-Man, Spider-Man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.34,0:55:27.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道 我是说 我有时候在想：{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, you know, I mean, I'm thinking to myself:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.91,0:55:31.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"我只不过是个小地方来的书呆子 这一切该是属于我的吗? "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm just a nerdy kid from Queens. Do I deserve this?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.95,0:55:35.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.69,0:55:36.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.60,0:55:47.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我父母和我正好来吃晚饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, my parents and I were just having dinner here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:50.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好 我叫格温·斯塔西 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. I'm Gwen Stacy. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.57,0:55:52.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是玛莉·珍·华森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mary Jane Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.34,0:55:58.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 终于能够见到你了 彼得成天提起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's so nice to finally meet you. Pete talks about you all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.38,0:56:04.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格温是我卡诺斯博士课程的试验搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gwen is my lab partner in Dr. Connors' class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.55,0:56:07.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得是个天才 没有他我也许就要放弃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete's something of a genius. I'd be completely lost without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.85,0:56:09.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然想起来了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which actually reminds me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.95,0:56:13.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你有没有拍到我跟蜘蛛侠接吻的照片啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Pete, if you've got a picture of my kiss with Spider-Man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.29,0:56:15.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能带到班上来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...could you bring it to class?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.69,0:56:19.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我太喜欢了 可以贴在我的包包上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd really love it. For my portfolio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.06,0:56:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟有几个人能被蜘蛛侠吻到呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, who gets kissed by Spider-Man, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.70,0:56:25.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,确实难以想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.67,0:56:29.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 真的很高兴能见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it was lovely to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.24,0:56:31.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night. - Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.09,0:56:44.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 她和我一起上科学课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she's in my science class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.19,0:56:47.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并不是她的强项{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not her best subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.56,0:56:50.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.83,0:56:53.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么从来没有提起过她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you never mentioned her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.50,0:56:56.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她是你的试验搭档?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's your lab partner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.07,0:56:59.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你救过她的命?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved her life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.37,0:57:00.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她还觉得你是个天才...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thinks you're a genius...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.87,0:57:04.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她还把她漂亮的手指甲随意搭在你的肩上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and she had her polished fingernails all over you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.41,0:57:05.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有注意到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or didn't you notice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.51,0:57:10.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她让蜘蛛侠成了城市英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she gave Spider-Man the key to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:13.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远也不会忘记的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never forget that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.59,0:57:18.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她只不过是一个班上的同学罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's just a girl in my class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.19,0:57:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我问问你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.13,0:57:23.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你吻她的时候...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you kissed her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.29,0:57:25.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是谁在吻她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who was kissing her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.86,0:57:28.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠还是彼得?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man or Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.77,0:57:31.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这是什么意思? - 你很清楚我是什么意思!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - You know exactly what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.84,0:57:34.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们的吻啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was our kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.34,0:57:35.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要那么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.81,0:57:39.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道那会让我怎么想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have known how it'd make me feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.41,0:57:43.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是不是想甩了我? - 甩了你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you wanna push me away? - Push you away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.08,0:57:46.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要甩了你啊? 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I wanna push you away? I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.82,0:57:50.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的女朋友 她只不过是我的一个同学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my girlfriend. She's a girl in my class, M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.22,0:57:54.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉很不好 对不起 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel well. I'm sorry, I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.56,0:57:55.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 等一...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, w...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.26,0:58:00.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要去哪儿啊? - 求你了 不要跟着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - Please, don't follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.43,0:58:04.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.44,0:58:44.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我是玛莉 请在哔一声后留言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, it's M.J. Sing your song at the beep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.98,0:58:47.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.08,0:58:53.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你能拿起电话来 我不知道是怎么回事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you'd pick up the phone. I don't know what's going on or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.95,0:58:56.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道你是否收到了我的短信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you got the messages or what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.49,0:58:58.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.89,0:59:02.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我只是想跟你说说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I just wanna talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.83,0:59:06.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 给我打电话 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, call me. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.61,0:59:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂? - 帕克先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Mr. Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.28,0:59:20.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.58,0:59:23.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是32区的尼尔·加特勒探长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Detective Neil Garrett from the 32nd Precinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.21,0:59:24.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是代表斯塔西队长给你打电话的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm calling on behalf of Captain Stacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.15,0:59:27.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他希望你能到警局来一趟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would like you to come down to the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.75,0:59:31.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起初 我们觉得这个人 丹尼斯·卡雷丁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Originally, we thought that this man, Dennis Carradine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.39,0:59:33.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是杀害你丈夫的凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was your husband's killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.66,0:59:35.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.83,0:59:36.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.10,0:59:39.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在看来卡雷丁先生只不过是个帮凶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out Mr. Carradine was only an accomplice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.06,0:59:42.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真正的凶手仍然在逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The actual killer is still at large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.67,0:59:44.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.54,0:59:46.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个人才是杀害你丈夫的凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the man who killed your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.91,0:59:53.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫弗林特·马克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Flint Marko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.28,0:59:56.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个经常出入监狱的三流骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a small-time crook who's been in and out of prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.45,0:59:57.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们搞错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got this wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.05,0:59:59.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两天前他逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two days ago he escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.22,1:00:02.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很显然他向狱友承认了自己的罪行...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evidently, he confessed his guilt to a cellmate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.95,1:00:06.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,此外我们也有许多证人可以证实这件事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we have a couple of witnesses who will corroborate the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.94,1:00:21.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 等一下 孩子 你不会这么做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait, son. You don't wanna do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.78,1:00:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.05,1:00:37.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 上车啊 你干什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, get in! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能把这些照片拿走啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you put these photos away, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.61,1:01:00.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 帕克太太? 我知道这很难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mrs. Parker. I know this isn't easy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.05,1:01:03.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 拜托你 还是有点耐心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but, please, be patient with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.65,1:01:05.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也正在工作 会抓到他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're doing our job. We will catch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.68,1:01:07.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你们并没有做好自己的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not doing your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.49,1:01:10.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看着我叔叔死去 然后还追错了人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched my uncle die, and we chased down the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.46,1:01:13.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你又说这两年你们又找到的嫌犯? 证人呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're telling me you had suspicions for two years? Witnesses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.69,1:01:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么不早告诉我们? - 冷静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why weren't we told about this? - Settle down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.03,1:01:17.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no intention of settling down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.93,1:01:20.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个家伙杀了我叔叔 现在还逍遥法外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man killed my uncle, and he's still out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.51,1:01:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,L-20公园专用道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L-20 Parkway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.21,1:01:33.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,附近的警官请报告自己的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All officers in the vicinity, please report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.01,1:01:35.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现了一辆废弃的汽车...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an abandoned vehicle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.65,1:01:37.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有路中间的一个老人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and an elderly man in the middle of the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.08,1:01:40.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 是瓦尔·贝什路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Wabash Avenue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.45,1:01:44.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 我是玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, it's M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.06,1:01:48.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是为了晚饭的事来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here about what happened at dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.33,1:01:49.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 开门吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just please open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.07,1:01:59.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梅婶给我打电话了 告诉了我发生的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt May called me. She told me about what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.74,1:02:01.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她很担心你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's worried about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.14,1:02:03.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很担心你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm worried about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.74,1:02:05.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.88,1:02:07.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想让你去做傻事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to do something stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.95,1:02:10.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是去找杀害我叔叔的凶手?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like try to find my uncle's killer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.55,1:02:12.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有做让你自己后悔的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do something you'll regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.18,1:02:16.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是那个家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like with that other guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.75,1:02:19.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他拿枪指着我 我躲开了 他就摔下去了 我都跟你说过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a gun on me. I made a move and he fell. I told you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.12,1:02:23.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我并没有要指责你 - 10-22 在556...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not accusing you of anything. - 10-22, auto at 556...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.53,1:02:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能不能把那个先关上? - 正在从第5-6街口向5-7街口移动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you turn that thing off? - Crossing 5-6 to 5-7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.63,1:02:32.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥中心 这里是3-9号车 第六大道的呼叫已收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Central, this is Car 3-9 responding to your Sixth Avenue call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.64,1:02:36.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 我来是因为我担心你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, I'm here because I care about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.21,1:02:39.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道你犯了一个错 让你有负罪感...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know that you made a mistake and that you feel guilty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.91,1:02:43.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我就是为你而来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I wanna be here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.61,1:02:46.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我知道 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I get it. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.92,1:02:49.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我很好...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm fine. L...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.72,1:02:51.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.96,1:03:01.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都会需要帮助的 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody needs help sometimes, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.00,1:03:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.08,1:03:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,90 X射线, 98{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninety X-ray, 98.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.51,1:03:21.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,2-4号 金, 收到关于麦迪逊道642号的呼叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two-four King, respond to 1031 at 642 Madison Ave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.39,1:03:26.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1-3号 托马斯 收到东107街540号的呼叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One-three Thomas, respond to 1020 at 540 East 107.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.46,1:03:30.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,公寓内有男性投诉者 可能在一楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Male complainant inside apartment. May be on first floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.73,1:03:37.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,10-11号 亨利 有一处住宅 73818...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three Henry 10-11, I have a residence. 73818...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.44,1:04:39.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别伤害我 给我一次机会吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hurt me. Just give me a chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.34,1:04:42.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我叔叔呢? 你有给他一次机会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about my uncle? Did you give him a chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.44,1:04:43.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.79,1:04:57.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪儿啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.81,1:05:15.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.78,1:05:19.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这感觉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.02,1:05:26.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这感觉真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This feels good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.20,1:05:39.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,耶!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.25,1:05:57.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是另一种完全不同的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.95,1:06:01.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么发现没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.39,1:06:03.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有见过像这样的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.66,1:06:05.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个物理学家 不是生物学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a physicist, not a biologist...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.66,1:06:08.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到了早上我会再研究一下 做些测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but let me look at it in the morning. Run some tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.53,1:06:09.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以现在就做吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we do that now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.60,1:06:16.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来它喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems to like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.37,1:06:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要让这东西依附到你身上 - 为什么不?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't let any of that get on you. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.14,1:06:24.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它具有寄生体的特性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has the characteristics of a symbiote...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.88,1:06:27.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着它需要寄生在 宿主身上才能生存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which needs to bond to a host to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.18,1:06:31.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上有时这类生物 一旦它们依附在宿主身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And sometimes these things in nature, when they bind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.92,1:06:34.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想摆脱它们就非常困难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they can be hard to unbind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.79,1:06:39.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正在发生一起银行劫案 地点在俾斯麦街202号的第一东亚银行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bank robbery in progress, First Eastern Bank at 202 Bismark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.73,1:06:42.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据报道另一起沙暴就发生在附近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another sandstorm is reported in the vicinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.46,1:06:45.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 所有车辆小心行驶 - 马克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All cars proceed with caution. - Marko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.42,1:07:42.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 很喜欢这套新衣服吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy, love the new outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.99,1:07:44.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这正是我所需要的独家新闻 比帕克抢先报道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is exactly what I need to scoop Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.19,1:07:46.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摆出你的招牌动作弹射蜘蛛网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give some of that web action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.76,1:07:50.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you, chump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.40,1:07:54.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么惹着你啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.58,1:08:37.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗林特·马克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flint Marko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.55,1:08:43.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你到底想对我怎样? - 还记得班·帕克吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want from me? - Remember Ben Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.25,1:08:47.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个被你残忍枪杀了的老人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old man you shot down in cold blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.72,1:08:50.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这到底又碍你什么啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it matter to you, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.23,1:08:53.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.37,1:09:33.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该是血债血偿的时候了 马克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to pay, Marko!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.67,1:10:45.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安息吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good riddance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.59,1:11:09.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 房租 - 现在没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rent. - Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.50,1:11:12.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 这是个自由的国家 但不是免房租的国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, it's a free country. It's not rent-free country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.60,1:11:14.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 少惹我 - 你得交房租{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave me alone. - Give me rent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.70,1:11:17.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要房租 那你得先修好这该死的房门!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get your rent when you fix this damn door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.85,1:11:30.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来火药味很浓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.15,1:11:35.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他脾气向来很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.92,1:11:38.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是碰到麻烦事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must be in some kind of trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.97,1:12:30.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗林特·马克是杀死叔叔班的凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flint Marko, the man who killed Uncle Ben...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.24,1:12:33.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他昨晚被杀死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he was killed last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.81,1:12:35.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.12,1:12:37.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.75,1:12:39.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠杀死他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.12,1:12:42.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.16,1:12:45.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这就不明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.39,1:12:48.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠不会杀人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man doesn't kill people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.66,1:12:51.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.23,1:12:55.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.80,1:12:58.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.87,1:13:00.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.68,1:13:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你会觉得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that you'd feel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.18,1:13:12.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他罪有应得的 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He deserved it, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.79,1:13:14.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为我们有权力去评判{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it's for us to say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.69,1:13:18.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别人是否应该活着或死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whether a person deserves to live or die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.26,1:13:21.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他杀死了叔叔班 梅婶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Aunt May, he killed Uncle Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.13,1:13:24.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,班对我们非常重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Ben meant the world to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.83,1:13:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他绝不愿我们有丝毫的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he wouldn't want us living one second...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.40,1:13:31.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇心理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with revenge in our hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.54,1:13:35.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这好比毒药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a poison. It can...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.78,1:13:38.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它能够控制你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can take you over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.78,1:13:45.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你察觉到之前 就把我们变成一些丑陋的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you know it, turn us into something ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.70,1:14:02.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他说这主意不错 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He said it was a good idea. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.45,1:14:48.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.75,1:14:50.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 哈利 我是玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Harry, it's M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.48,1:14:51.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.72,1:14:53.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想找个人陪陪我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need some company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.32,1:14:55.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你忙吗? 我可以去看你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you doing anything? Can I stop by?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.92,1:14:57.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 过来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure, come on over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.16,1:15:00.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你确定不会打扰你吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Are you sure it's okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.63,1:15:03.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我现在没事儿 快过来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not doing anything. Please, come over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.40,1:15:06.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 待会儿见 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, I'll see you soon. - Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.23,1:15:07.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.64,1:15:10.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伯纳德 - 有何吩咐 奥斯伯恩先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bernard. - Yes, Mr. Osborn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.00,1:15:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有位客人要到访 你能去准备一些吃的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're having a guest. Can you get some food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.41,1:15:15.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一位客人? - 对 一位客人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A guest? - Yeah, a guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.78,1:15:19.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是"客人"的客人吗? - 别问那么多了 你去准备吃的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A "guest" guest? - Will you just get some food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.31,1:15:20.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就去 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right away, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.83,1:15:40.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 迪克维奇先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mr. Ditkovitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.47,1:15:44.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吃橙子吗? - 不吃 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An orange? - No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.44,1:15:48.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对刚才发生的事情感到很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm really sorry for what happened earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.41,1:15:51.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该大声抱怨这房门 这没有什么值得生气的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't have yelled about that door. It was nothing to be angry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.01,1:15:53.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.15,1:15:58.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你心里感到不安的话 你可以找个时间请我吃披萨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you feel that bad about it, you can buy me pizza sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.39,1:16:01.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不如就今天吧? - 好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Today's good. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.69,1:16:04.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那电话有什么问题吗? - 没有 我只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have problem with the phone? - No, no. I was just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.52,1:16:06.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在琢磨说什么好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was trying to figure out what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.76,1:16:10.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你给女人打电话 你就说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's a woman you're calling, then you say:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.66,1:16:14.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"你是个优秀的女人 我是个优秀的男人"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're a good woman. I am good man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.17,1:16:20.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 彼得 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Pete. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.17,1:16:22.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在给女人打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's calling a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.51,1:16:24.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在给玛莉打电话吗? 我想这很好...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane? I think that would be so good...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.61,1:16:28.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关你啥事? 去 去 打电话吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is none of your business. Go. Go. Call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.38,1:16:32.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你应该打电话给玛莉   - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You should call. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.42,1:16:37.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 - 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye. - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.40,1:16:52.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.71,1:16:58.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你饿了吗? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hungry? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.31,1:17:00.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.95,1:17:07.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我希望你喜欢辣椒 - 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hope you like peppers. - I love them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.28,1:17:33.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.39,1:17:46.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 奶油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the butter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.50,1:17:58.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.68,1:18:04.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你仔细看好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.55,1:18:13.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以吃这部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can use that part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.69,1:18:17.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.82,1:18:20.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是自欺欺人 好度过那漫漫长夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing like a little self-deception to get you through the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.19,1:18:23.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 你什么时候写的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - When did you write that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.20,1:18:26.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 12年级 - 剧情很紧凑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twelfth grade. - It's intense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.17,1:18:30.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么你想演出那部分? - 我非常荣幸参与演出你的戏剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you want the part? - I'd love to be in your play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.00,1:18:32.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.61,1:18:37.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 甚至连个疤痕都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, there's not even a scar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.55,1:18:41.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看不出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.70,1:19:00.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起 - 我也对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.40,1:19:04.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不是故意的 - 不 没关系 请原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't mean to do that. - No, it's okay. Please, forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.91,1:19:07.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.48,1:19:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.01,1:19:13.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛莉 - 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mary Jane, please. - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.18,1:19:15.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.59,1:19:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有按计划去做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've taken your eye off the ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.27,1:19:38.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.75,1:19:52.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你都干了些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.72,1:19:57.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为我报仇!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avenge me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.43,1:20:04.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我父亲 他死了 是吧? - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My father, he died, right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.66,1:20:06.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是希望我可以想起更多关于他的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wish I could remember more about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.03,1:20:10.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他爱你 那是最重要的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he loved you. That's the main thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.24,1:20:13.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在我父亲坟墓前发誓 蜘蛛侠要偿还这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear on my father's grave, Spider-Man will pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.17,1:20:15.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.64,1:20:19.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.48,1:20:24.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 爸爸 我记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Father. I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.52,1:20:27.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对她和彼得的看法是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was right about her. About Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.99,1:20:30.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对所有的事情的看法都是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.62,1:20:35.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你必须做些什么 让他痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you must do. Make him suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.56,1:20:37.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他生不如死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him wish he were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.06,1:20:41.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先 我们要攻击他的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, we attack his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.18,1:20:55.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 是我 在哔一声后留下你的美妙歌声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, it's me. Sing your song at the beep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.35,1:20:58.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 M.J. 我是彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, M.J. It's Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.22,1:21:03.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你谈谈昨晚的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk to you about last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.89,1:21:05.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道昨晚我在想些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what I was thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.19,1:21:10.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你去那儿是想帮我 但我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you were just there to help and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.16,1:21:14.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I wanna see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.67,1:21:22.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想彼得活命的话 你得为我做些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want Peter to live, you're gonna do something for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.65,1:21:28.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁啊? - 乌苏拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - It's Ursula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.35,1:21:30.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.79,1:21:40.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 彼得 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Pete. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.66,1:21:42.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有电话找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a phone call for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.26,1:21:45.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是玛莉 她给你回电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mary Jane, she called back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.10,1:21:48.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的吗? - 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.80,1:21:55.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我把电话筒放在那上面 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I put the phone on top of the thing. - Thanks. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.41,1:21:58.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.15,1:22:01.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我真高兴你给我打电话 我想尽...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm so glad you called. I've been trying to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.98,1:22:04.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能来见我吗? - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you meet me? - You bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.95,1:22:07.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在? - 行 在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now? - Okay. Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.52,1:22:09.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在公园里的桥上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the bridge in the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.56,1:22:10.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我这儿就来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On my way. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.06,1:22:13.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Hey. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.38,1:22:35.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.75,1:22:38.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,牡丹花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peonies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.79,1:22:43.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吧? - 不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.39,1:22:46.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你一些事情 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I have to tell you, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.96,1:22:48.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.66,1:22:51.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你之间的感情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.37,1:22:53.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出现了问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.10,1:22:56.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.84,1:22:59.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再见到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna see you anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.77,1:23:01.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.74,1:23:03.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.55,1:23:08.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很寂寞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm lonely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.55,1:23:11.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能为我解除寂寞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aren't there for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.92,1:23:15.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也受不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.52,1:23:21.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们之间的关系完了 - 不 求你不要这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's over. - No. Please. Please don't say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.79,1:23:24.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我一向自私 但我可以做得更好 我能改{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I've been selfish, but I can do better. I can change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.76,1:23:28.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 事情并不是那么简单 - 我们彼此相爱 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not that simple. - We love each other. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.63,1:23:30.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是有问题 当人们碰到问题时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have problems. When people have problems...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.90,1:23:33.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会想办法解决 他们跟对方交谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they work it out. They talk to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.71,1:23:40.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.68,1:23:43.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.92,1:23:48.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我对我们的期望吗? - 我有别人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what I want for us? - There's someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.29,1:23:51.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱上另外一个人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've fallen in love with someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.78,1:24:14.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.39,1:24:28.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说她感到寂寞 我不能为她解除寂寞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says that she's lonely, that I'm not there for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.16,1:24:32.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有了第三者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.40,1:24:37.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你准备如何承受这一切?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how you holding up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.94,1:24:39.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.71,1:24:44.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利 我打算向她求婚的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry, I was gonna propose to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.28,1:24:46.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.05,1:24:52.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她最近一段日子比较困难 关于她的事业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she's been going through a tough time lately. Career.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.15,1:24:55.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是 在爵士俱乐部当歌手女招待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, a singing waitress at a jazz club?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.16,1:24:59.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是她心目中想要的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not exactly what she had in mind for herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.33,1:25:02.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,歌手女招待? 你在说些什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Singing waitress? What are you... What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.60,1:25:07.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 她被剧组解雇了 她没有告诉你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she was fired from the show. Didn't she tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.50,1:25:08.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她被解雇了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was fired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.57,1:25:15.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她被解雇了 她告诉了你? 却没有告诉我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was fired and she told you? She didn't tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.34,1:25:19.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 这也是我要你到这来的原因 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's why I asked you here, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.05,1:25:23.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是那个第三者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the other guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.92,1:25:26.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.82,1:25:29.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个下午她遇到麻烦来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, she came to me one afternoon, troubled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.99,1:25:32.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她需要人陪 我那时在她身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She needed someone and I was there for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.76,1:25:36.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都爱着她 彼得 这是你知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always loved her, Pete. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.00,1:25:38.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这刚刚...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.97,1:25:40.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.37,1:25:51.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信这是真的 我不...我不相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe this. I don't... I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.84,1:25:54.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感到非常抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm really sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.75,1:25:58.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得你应该知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought you should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.29,1:26:09.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 需要添点热咖啡吗? - 好的 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I warm you up? - Yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.30,1:26:12.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这果馅派怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the pie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.83,1:26:15.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.86,1:27:20.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想喝点东西吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.50,1:27:25.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我在想什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. What was I thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.21,1:27:28.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有损公众形象 对吧 城市英雄先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad for the public image, right, Mr. Key-to-the-City?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.91,1:27:30.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对她干了些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.31,1:27:35.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做那些你没有做到的事情 我在她身边 替她解除寂寞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what you failed to do. I was there for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.95,1:27:38.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉和我 我们互相了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane and I, we understand each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.28,1:27:43.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她不知道你的真面目 - 彼得 她非常了解我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She doesn't know what you are. - Peter, she knows me very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.46,1:27:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当她吻我的时候 正如她过去吻我一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when she kissed me, it was just like she used to kiss me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.09,1:27:49.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那味道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That taste...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.43,1:27:52.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好像草莓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strawberries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.33,1:28:29.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉如何 蜘蛛大侠?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you like that, Spidey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.74,1:28:35.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这些了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That all you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.35,1:28:44.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 感觉刺痛 对吧? - 我在高中时保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stings, doesn't it? - I protected you in high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.05,1:28:47.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要教训教训你这兔崽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm gonna kick your little ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.57,1:29:36.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要像杀死我父亲那样杀死我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna kill me like you killed my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.64,1:29:38.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再去试着让你相信什么了 （不是我杀死你父亲）{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done trying to convince you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.61,1:29:43.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把他从我这儿夺走了 他爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took him from me. He loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.24,1:29:47.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 他看不起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He despised you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.31,1:29:49.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你让他脸上无光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were an embarrassment to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.35,1:29:57.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个小妖怪 想哭吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at little Goblin Junior. Gonna cry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.06,1:30:36.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠过去总是让我充满安全感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man used to make me feel safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.46,1:30:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我害怕下班后走路回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm afraid to walk home from work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.56,1:30:42.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我儿子脑海里全是这家伙 - 我有个女儿 爱死了蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My son thought the world of this guy. - I have a daughter, loves Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.40,1:30:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她该崇拜谁? - 这就是他们推崇的那个城市英雄吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's she to look up to? - This is the guy they gave the key to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.97,1:30:49.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要抹黑你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna put some dirt in your eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.81,1:30:54.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为新摄影师同事干杯 - 嘿 我只是比较幸运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cheers to the new staff photographer. - Hey, I just got lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.15,1:30:56.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真了不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so wonderful for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.05,1:31:00.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你或许告诉詹姆士去弄大点的墙壁空间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you might wanna tell J.J. To make a little more wall space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.79,1:31:09.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 今天天气真好 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, good morning. It's a beautiful day, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.36,1:31:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么说的来着? 我永远不会拍到那相片?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it you said? I'll never get that picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.60,1:31:14.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的偶像在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's your hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.94,1:31:19.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我从没有想过他真是那样的 - 看到了没有? 就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never thought he'd really do that. - See? Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.64,1:31:22.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有依据吗? 你得相信你所看到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a judgment call. You gotta see it as it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.44,1:31:23.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这么说真有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny you should say that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.98,1:31:28.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我浏览了一些旧相片 看到这相片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because I was looking through some old photos and it looks very...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.38,1:31:30.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很眼熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...similar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.35,1:31:34.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 呃 我得回去干活了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Well, I gotta get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.49,1:31:38.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好没出息 布洛克 - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're trash, Brock. - Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.62,1:31:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的相片是伪造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your picture's a fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.53,1:31:45.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 帕克 你不要太小孩子气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Parker, you are such a boy scout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.87,1:31:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候才会原谅别人呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you gonna give a guy a break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.94,1:31:52.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要谅解? 去信教吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want forgiveness? Get religion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.80,1:31:55.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这里出什么事了? - 你们没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on here? - Are you guys all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.04,1:32:02.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 没事 我们只是在闹着玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. No, we... We're just horsing around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.05,1:32:07.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我求你了 如果你这样做 我会失去所有的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm begging you. If you do this, I will lose everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.25,1:32:09.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,城里不会再有报馆会聘请我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not a paper in town that will hire me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.69,1:32:11.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你早就应该想到这点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've thought of that earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.73,1:32:14.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 彼得?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.13,1:32:19.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个给你的编辑看看 告诉他记得下次检查照片来源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show this to your editor. Tell him to check his source next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.50,1:32:27.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是假的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.27,1:32:31.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约摄影协会证实了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Empire State Photographic Department confirms it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.88,1:32:37.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卷包袱给我滚蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pack your things. Get out of my building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.25,1:32:39.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只是... - 你被炒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was just trying... - You're fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.99,1:32:43.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们得刊登撤回相片的声明了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to print a retraction now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.46,1:32:45.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有刊登撤销声明20年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't printed a retraction in 20 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.70,1:32:54.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂 - 帕克先生 我是卡诺斯博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Mr. Parker, Dr. Connors here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.50,1:32:58.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 卡诺斯博士 你好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dr. Connors. How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.80,1:33:01.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你上次留给我的实验品相当古怪 帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite a specimen you left me, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.44,1:33:06.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它的化学组成不像七十年代的球粒陨石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its chemistry is not unlike the chondritic meteorites of the '70s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.11,1:33:08.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.48,1:33:10.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好吃 - 你知道吗 帕克?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's good. - You know what, Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.95,1:33:15.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帕克? - 去拿杯牛奶给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Parker? - Get me some milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.52,1:33:20.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它放大宿主的特性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It amplifies characteristics of its host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.26,1:33:23.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 再给我一块曲奇饼 - 特别是攻击性方面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, give me another cookie. - Especially aggression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.00,1:33:26.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这会很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.07,1:33:30.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你没有保留一部分 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, you didn't keep any, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.74,1:33:34.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你有没有带果仁的牛奶? - 我有果仁 我可以做一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got any with nuts? - I have some nuts. I could make some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.61,1:33:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那去做一些给我 - 彼得?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go make me some. - Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.48,1:33:38.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没有 当然没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.43,1:33:55.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些相片真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These shots are so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.46,1:33:57.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很愿意给你拍照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to shoot you sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.50,1:34:01.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得·帕克 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Parker. Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.07,1:34:06.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克 布莱恩特小姐 我雇你们可不是干那个的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker. Miss Brant, that's not the position I hired you for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.54,1:34:08.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,穿黑衣服的蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black-suit Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.54,1:34:11.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 这些真是不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, these are incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.88,1:34:14.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们需要这些照片 约拿 - 我按老价钱给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We gotta have these, Jonah. - I'll pay you the usual rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.72,1:34:19.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想要这些照片 你得正式聘用我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want the shots, I'll take the staff job...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.52,1:34:21.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,价格加倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...double the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.47,1:35:47.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,佩妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.95,1:35:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的该来这儿的酒吧玩玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are really gonna dig this joint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.92,1:35:59.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我怎样? 穿着合适吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I'm... I'm dressed all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.12,1:36:01.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太鲜艳还是...?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too fancy or too...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.85,1:36:05.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说笑吧? 你看上去很好 宝贝儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? You're looking fine, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.06,1:36:09.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 我喜欢你的笑声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Love that little giggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.56,1:36:14.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计 就让那开着好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, keep it open there, pops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.77,1:36:21.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 真是酷毙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is so cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.41,1:36:24.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还从没有到过爵士酒吧呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never been to a jazz club before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.91,1:36:30.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 希望我们能找到一张桌子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I hope we can get a table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.02,1:36:37.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我们找一处光线比较暗的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find us some shade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.59,1:36:40.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 美腿小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, hot legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.09,1:36:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这边来 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right this way, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.00,1:36:53.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, why, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.31,1:37:02.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我真是太喜欢这地方了 - 我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am so loving this. - Oh, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.82,1:37:11.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那不是你以前的女朋友吗? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that your old girlfriend? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.49,1:37:15.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想换别的地方吗? - 噢 不 不 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you wanna go someplace else? - Oh, no, no. I'll... I'll be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.99,1:37:18.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉 露两手给大家看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane, show us what you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.54,1:37:27.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我很快回来 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be right back. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.72,1:37:37.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.99,1:37:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是献给你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.53,1:37:50.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双倍票价的表演来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double-time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.33,1:37:57.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.76,1:38:25.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在该到这个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now dig on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.90,1:38:28.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太辣了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.24,1:39:10.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你所做的这些全是为了她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was all for her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.65,1:39:21.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.60,1:39:36.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还好吗 玛莉? - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You all right, Mary Jane? - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.23,1:39:37.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.64,1:39:42.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.28,1:39:45.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你发什么疯啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.88,1:39:48.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.78,1:39:51.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么可以为您效劳的吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I help you, sir? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.98,1:39:54.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里一切都好吧 保罗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything okay here, Paul?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.22,1:39:56.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 这里一切都好吧 保罗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, is everything okay here, Paul?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.62,1:39:58.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把他领出去 - 我们走吧 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take him out of here. - Let's go, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.19,1:40:01.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把你的手拿开 - 马上走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take your hand off of me. - Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.16,1:40:05.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 嘿 放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Hey, get off. Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.13,1:40:09.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.35,1:40:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.28,1:40:26.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.51,1:42:01.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是布洛克 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Brock, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.58,1:42:04.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小爱德华·布洛克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward Brock Jr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.72,1:42:08.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天来到你面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come before you today...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.89,1:42:11.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,满怀谦卑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...humbled...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.39,1:42:15.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和屈辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and humiliated...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.36,1:42:20.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来请求您一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to ask you for one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.24,1:42:28.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想请您杀死彼得· 帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to kill Peter Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.09,1:43:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.16,1:45:06.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 彼得 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Peter. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.07,1:45:13.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你并没有怎样改变过你的房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seem to have changed the room around very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.71,1:45:17.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 也没有什么可以让你改变的 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, there's not much you could do, is there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.25,1:45:26.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我们通电话的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we spoke on the phone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.65,1:45:29.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉到你有心事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I sensed that something was bothering you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.82,1:45:33.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我决定过来看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so I thought I'd just come by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.49,1:45:37.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉还好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's Mary Jane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.40,1:45:40.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.47,1:45:44.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有听到过你的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never heard from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.14,1:45:47.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你向她求婚了没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever propose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.68,1:45:53.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.31,1:45:57.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当丈夫的需要为妻子着想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a husband's gotta put a wife before himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.05,1:46:04.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.29,1:46:09.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是发生了什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.26,1:46:12.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你如此肯定?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seemed so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.03,1:46:15.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.94,1:46:18.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.98,1:46:31.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我伤害了她 梅婶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hurt her, Aunt May.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.62,1:46:34.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎样做才好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.52,1:46:40.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就从最困难的部分做起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you start by doing the hardest thing:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.09,1:46:44.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不要自责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgive yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.20,1:46:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我信任你 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe in you, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.90,1:46:52.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a good person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.84,1:46:58.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你会找到办法把事情解决好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know you will find a way to put it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.38,1:47:08.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并且及时的解决好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.30,1:47:28.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠 受死吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End of the line, Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.74,1:47:35.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想他死 弗林特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him dead too, Flint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.61,1:47:37.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我找你的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I've been looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.08,1:47:41.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 对了 我知道你的所有事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. I know all about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.52,1:47:45.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是蜘蛛侠不让你帮助你那可怜的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the fact that Spider-Man won't let you help your poor daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.92,1:47:49.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来 这太可恶了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just... That doesn't seem right to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.39,1:47:54.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想杀死这蜘蛛 你也想杀死这蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I wanna kill the spider, you wanna kill the spider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.50,1:47:57.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们联手 他必死无疑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, he doesn't stand a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.80,1:48:00.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感兴趣吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.24,1:48:03.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.70,1:49:06.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.24,1:49:09.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.64,1:49:12.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全纽约人都屏住呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All New York is holding its breath...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.54,1:49:15.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关注人质事件进展{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as the hostage crisis continues to unfold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.92,1:49:18.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大约30分钟前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just 30 minutes ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.35,1:49:20.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警察来到这惊人的现场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...police came across this startling sight:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.62,1:49:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个被劫持在的士当人质的年轻妇女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young woman, held hostage in a taxi...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.92,1:49:25.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,悬停在离地面80层楼高的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...suspended 80 stories above the ground...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.39,1:49:28.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那里就像一张巨大的蜘蛛网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in what appears to be a giant web.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.43,1:49:31.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警方所有试图搭救人质的行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every attempt by the police to rescue the hostage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.23,1:49:32.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都被那沙人阻止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has been thwarted by the Sandman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.47,1:49:37.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,参与其中的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compounding the danger...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.90,1:49:40.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一名奇怪的黑衣人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the appearance of a strange black-suited figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.97,1:49:44.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早期报道相信他是穿黑衣的蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Early reports had believed him to be the black-suited Spider-Man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.81,1:49:48.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在他被证实是完全不同的个体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he has now been identified as something entirely different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.01,1:49:53.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人质被确认是玛莉·珍·华森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hostage has been identified as Mary Jane Watson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.72,1:49:57.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个最近在百老汇很少登台的女演员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...an actress recently seen in a brief stint on Broadway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.51,1:50:25.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在带你到现场去看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're now going to take you live to the scene...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.08,1:50:27.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹妮弗·杜根就在现场 詹妮弗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with Jennifer Dugan. Jennifer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.09,1:50:30.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们大约在100英尺外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're only about 100 feet away now, Hal, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.80,1:50:34.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 蛛网上好像有动静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. There seems to be some kind of activity in the web.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.77,1:50:38.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们好像在写一些巨大的字母{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem to be creating some kind of gigantic lettering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.16,1:50:43.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠面临着一场正面的挑战 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man's being challenged to some sort of confrontation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.13,1:50:45.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不得不面对一个严峻问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that raises serious questions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.96,1:50:49.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是面对如此势不可挡的挑战 他取胜的机会有多大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about what kind of chance he'd stand against such overwhelming...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.68,1:51:01.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.58,1:51:06.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.02,1:51:10.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能打赢他们俩 不能单靠我一人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't take them both, not by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.89,1:51:19.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不配我的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't deserve my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.57,1:51:24.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.77,1:51:26.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她需要我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...she needs us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.38,1:51:32.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.56,1:51:51.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我可以的话 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.60,1:51:57.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见这屋里发生过的很多事情 但我从未说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen things in this house I've never spoken of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.47,1:52:00.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想告诉我什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you trying to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.04,1:52:03.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲死的那晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The night your father died...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.94,1:52:06.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我清理他的伤口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I cleaned his wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.91,1:52:11.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,穿透他身体的刀刃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blade that pierced his body...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.68,1:52:14.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来自他的滑翔机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...came from his glider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.25,1:52:20.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你试图捍卫你父亲的荣誉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're trying to defend your father's honor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.22,1:52:25.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但毫无疑问 他是死在自己的手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but there's no question that he died by his own hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.73,1:52:31.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved your father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.44,1:52:35.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我爱你一样 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as I have loved you, Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.01,1:52:38.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也和你的朋友爱你一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As your friends love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.89,1:53:27.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.05,1:53:51.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠! 蜘蛛侠! 蜘蛛侠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man! Spider-Man! Spider-Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.09,1:53:59.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正当所有的希望就要全落空的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems to have come out of nowhere...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.22,1:54:01.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他好像凌空跳出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to answer the prayers of the city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.39,1:54:03.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回应城里的祈祷者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just when all hope seemed to be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.37,1:54:12.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 他们要把我们两个都杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter. They're gonna kill us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.44,1:54:15.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要把你从这里救出去 - 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna get you out of this. - Watch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.38,1:54:26.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 帕克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.10,1:54:28.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 埃迪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God. Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.01,1:54:30.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的蜘蛛感觉在隐隐作痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My spider-sense is tingling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.44,1:54:35.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你知道我在说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you know what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.23,1:54:56.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能找到解决问题的办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can find a way to settle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.30,1:54:57.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的太对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.90,1:55:01.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在考虑用羞辱的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking humiliation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.11,1:55:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你羞辱我的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of like how you humiliated me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.31,1:55:07.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有忘记吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.88,1:55:11.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得你是怎样对付我的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember what you did to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.16,1:55:30.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我失去了我的女朋友 现在我也要让你失去你的女朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made me lose my girl. Now I'm gonna make you lose yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.64,1:55:34.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 大侠?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that sound, tiger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.50,1:56:36.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住 玛莉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Mary Jane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.33,1:57:08.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.13,1:58:12.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切简直难以令人相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to believe what's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.06,1:58:15.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太残忍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brutality of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.13,1:58:17.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他能否继续承受下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how he can take any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.10,1:58:21.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于纽约人民来说 这是个令人悲伤的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be a tragic day for the people of New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.84,1:58:23.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可能是蜘蛛侠生命结束的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be the end of Spider-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.23,1:58:52.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 了不起 - 真酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Awesome. - Wicked cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.49,1:59:18.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.90,1:59:28.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好像时间刚刚好 及时赶到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like just in the nick of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.14,1:59:31.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几分钟之前 事情也不是很糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple minutes ago wouldn't have been so bad either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.81,1:59:33.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.95,1:59:38.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这里可能需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may need some help over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.98,1:59:41.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在正有点忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a little busy right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.55,1:59:44.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的手递给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.77,2:00:01.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帕克! 帕克 在哪儿呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker! Parker, where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.81,2:00:03.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一个摄影师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a photographer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.54,2:00:04.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 小孩 你需要一份工作吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid, you want a job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.01,2:00:08.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么需要一份工作? 我还是小孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I want a job? I'm just a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.51,2:00:11.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 你的相机多少钱卖? - 一百块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, how much for the camera? - One hundred bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.58,2:00:13.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一百块?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred bucks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.95,2:00:18.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 你这小奸商 给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you little crook. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.42,2:00:21.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.73,2:00:25.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胶卷另计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Film's extra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.20,2:00:32.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打中了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.01,2:00:42.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 正上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete, up top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.13,2:01:04.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.34,2:01:08.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 事情还能更糟吗? - 抓住　{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This thing got any more? - Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.31,2:01:09.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.88,2:01:15.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去吧 老兄 - 抓住她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, buddy. - Got her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.06,2:01:28.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.23,2:01:31.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.50,2:01:36.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那就好 - 嘿 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. - Hey, Pete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.20,2:01:40.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有打扰你们吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I interrupting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.25,2:02:59.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,千万不要伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never wound...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.95,2:03:01.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些你不能够杀死的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what you can't kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.76,2:03:09.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃迪 你得脱掉那套衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eddie, the suit, you gotta take it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.46,2:03:11.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 你喜欢这套衣服 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you'd like that, wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.06,2:03:15.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道穿着那套衣服的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what it feels like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.43,2:03:18.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.24,2:03:20.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那力量 所有的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power. Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.94,2:03:23.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你会失去自我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll lose yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.01,2:03:25.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脱掉它吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.08,2:03:28.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢做坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like being bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.25,2:03:30.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这让我感到高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes me happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.50,2:04:21.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.64,2:05:36.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你要干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.94,2:05:39.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.51,2:05:42.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃迪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eddie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.03,2:06:03.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈利 - 玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Harry. - Mary Jane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.17,2:06:05.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去找人帮忙 - 不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna get help. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.84,2:06:08.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留下来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.98,2:06:18.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.52,2:06:25.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有选择余地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.49,2:06:31.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们总要做选择的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We always have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.76,2:06:33.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你杀死我叔叔时 你总要做一个选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a choice when you killed my uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.50,2:06:38.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我女儿快要死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter was dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.67,2:06:42.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我急需用钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.34,2:06:49.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.79,2:06:59.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你叔叔 我只要他的车子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told your uncle all I wanted was the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.06,2:07:01.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么啦? - 我需要你的车子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - I need your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.53,2:07:04.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他对我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said to me:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.16,2:07:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"为什么你不放下枪回家去? "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Why don't you just put down the gun and go home?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.04,2:07:14.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在意识到他在试图帮助我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I realize now he was just trying to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.75,2:07:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我看到我的同伴拿着现金跑来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I saw my partner running over with the cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.88,2:07:27.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他手里拿着枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the gun was in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.69,2:07:39.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.03,2:07:43.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做了一件对你非常可怕的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did a terrible thing to you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.77,2:07:48.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了无数个夜晚祈祷 希望可以挽回一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I spent a lot of nights wishing I could take it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:53.44,2:07:55.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在请求你原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not asking you to forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.95,2:07:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想让你了解真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want you to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.09,2:08:11.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也做过可怕的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done terrible things too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.98,2:08:30.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我选择要变成这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't choose to be this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.49,2:08:41.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在唯一令我留恋的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing left of me now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.16,2:08:46.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.31,2:09:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我原谅你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgive you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.62,2:09:46.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 兄弟 感觉怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, pal. How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.72,2:09:48.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好点了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.89,2:09:51.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会帮你渡过这一关的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get you through this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.57,2:09:57.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.74,2:10:06.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我本不该伤害你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should never have hurt you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.78,2:10:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说那些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...said those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.75,2:10:15.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的事情都不重要了 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of that matters, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.35,2:10:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.86,2:10:25.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:44.55,2:10:46.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.23,2:11:34.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论什么挡在我们面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever comes our way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.47,2:11:39.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论我们内心斗争多激烈 我们总要做出选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever battle we have raging inside us, we always have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.77,2:11:43.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友哈利教会了我这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend Harry taught me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.04,2:11:47.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他选择做我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He chose to be the best of himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.14,2:11:51.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是选择决定了我们成为什么样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the choices that make us who we are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.31,2:11:54.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们总是能选择去做正确的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we can always choose to do what's right.{\r}
